{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11204140","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11204140","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1120414001:0":{"text":"あちこちで聞いてみたんですが……ガリに手紙の代筆を頼んだジャクソンは、鹹水町ではあまり評判がよくなかったみたいですね。","source_cn":"四处打听了一圈，感觉……伽利，请你代笔写信的那个贾克松...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x619B956D8407A7AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120414002:0":{"text":"彼はどんな人だったんですか？","source_cn":"他究竟是个怎样的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0798F647544DB508","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120414003:0":{"text":"彼？さっき誰かが適切に表現してたけど、ジャクソンは強面だったよ。","source_cn":"他？刚才有人形容得比较准确，贾克松面相很凶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAE07D34CB6D3CC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120414004:0":{"text":"でも見た目だけで人を判断しちゃいけない！大事なのは、砂嵐から避難してる時に、彼は残り少ない水を僕にくれたってことだよ。","source_cn":"但外表只是假象，我们不能光从骨骼和皮肤上判断一个人！最...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE405E8F5999890E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120414005:0":{"text":"クリムゾン高原では水が多いほど生き残る可能性が高くなるって、自然学の手引書に書いてあったんだ。だから代わりに僕は手紙を書いてあげた、生きる希望を与えるために！","source_cn":"在深红高原，多一口水，就多一分活下去的可能性，学会自然...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA676EB7AA3641EE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120414006:0":{"text":"この手紙を絶対にジャクソンのお母さんに届けないと。そのためなら、野外調査を一日中断したっていい！","source_cn":"这封信一定得交到贾克松母亲手里，为此，我愿意暂停一天的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8540E330C2C254F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120414007:0":{"text":"おい！お前たち！さっきジャクソンの話をしてなかったか？あいつが戻ってきたのか？","source_cn":"嘿！你们！刚才有人在说贾克松，是不是？他回来了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99F3ED73A559BF11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120414008:0":{"text":"誰だ、人がいい話をしているのに。","source_cn":"嗯，是谁在插话……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A6F511888219E43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:梅丽莎":{"text":"メリッサ","source":"梅丽莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伽利":{"text":"ガリ","source":"伽利","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:突兀的声音":{"text":"突然聞こえてきた声","source":"突兀的声音","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}